OL,3,GNEWSA'Ghost' golf course near
OL,4,AGleneagles up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish golf resort located next to
OL,7,FGleneagles, which has been shrouded in
OL,8,Fsecrecy, has been put up for sale.
OL,10,FThe gWest course in Blackford, Perth
OL,11,Fand Kinross, was designed by architect
OL,12,FDavid McLay Kidd and completed in 2009
OL,13,F- but never officially opened to the
OL,14,Fpublic. Very few people are thought to
OL,15,Fhave played it.
OL,17,FIt is currently owned by Mahdi
OL,18,Fal-Tajir, the owner of mineral water
OL,19,Ffirm Highland Spring who was previously
OL,20,FScotland's richest man, and his family.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
