OL,3,GNEWSA'Ghost' golf course near
OL,4,AGleneagles up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 639-acre estate includes an 18-hole
OL,7,Fchampionship course and a clubhouse
OL,8,Fshell, as well as planning consent for
OL,9,Fup to 170 residential plots, a hotel
OL,10,Fand spa, leisure and entertainment
OL,11,Ffacilities, and staff accommodation.
